  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the roots of the equation&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi></math>, then<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br />Roots of the other equation are greater by unity, so it will be<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math>"
  }
